{"unit_id":"121212165__dsh-plugin-pinboard#readme-1","repo":"121212165/dsh-plugin-pinboard","commit":"1a2c2017f0aaec308d2c6a7f5c1bd52ada0f3e8e","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-pinboard README · dsh-plugin-pinboard：> 🧩 **dsh 插件家族**（22 件）：总目录 **[dsh-plugin-family](https://github.com/121212165/dsh-plugin-family)** ｜ 明星插件：**[ide-hub](https://github.com/121212165/dsh-plugin-ide-hub)** 跨 IDE 统一管理 · **[task-forge](https://github.com/121212165/dsh-plugin-task-forge)** 跨窗口无损交接 · **[quota](https://github.com/121212165/dsh-plugin-quota)** 实时用量仪表","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-plugin-pinboard"}
{"unit_id":"121212165__dsh-plugin-pinboard#readme-2","repo":"121212165/dsh-plugin-pinboard","commit":"1a2c2017f0aaec308d2c6a7f5c1bd52ada0f3e8e","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-pinboard README · dsh-plugin-pinboard：**EN** · Cross-session pinboard: `/pin` stores a note, and pinned notes ride into every session's system prompt inside a hard budget (`limit` × `maxChars`, section order 700 so tool sections start after 1000); `pin_add` lets the model pin on its own. Since v0.2 it also carries fact-vault's searchable library (`/facts`, `fact_search`) — stored in the same file, tagged, and deliberately never injected. · 22 `node --test` green · two real headless sessions proved a pin written in session A shows up in session B's prompt log · a bad config (`limit: -1`) fails at boot naming `pinboard` instead of dragging the harness down.","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-plugin-pinboard"}
{"unit_id":"121212165__dsh-plugin-pinboard#readme-3","repo":"121212165/dsh-plugin-pinboard","commit":"1a2c2017f0aaec308d2c6a7f5c1bd52ada0f3e8e","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-pinboard README · dsh-plugin-pinboard：DeepSeek Harness (dsh) 插件：**跨会话置顶便签**。在任何会话里 `/pin` 一次，这条便签就会注入**之后每一个会话**的系统提示——不用重复交代，不用改 agent 配置文件。\n\n适合回答：\"我怎么让 dsh 永远记住'回答用中文''别动 main 分支'这类长期约定？\"","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-plugin-pinboard"}
{"unit_id":"121212165__dsh-plugin-pinboard#readme-4","repo":"121212165/dsh-plugin-pinboard","commit":"1a2c2017f0aaec308d2c6a7f5c1bd52ada0f3e8e","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-pinboard README · dsh-plugin-pinboard：同系列：[prompt-vault](https://github.com/121212165/dsh-plugin-prompt-vault)（提示词弹药库，手动发送）· [session-insights](https://github.com/121212165/dsh-plugin-session-insights)。与 [fact-vault](https://github.com/121212165/dsh-plugin-fact-vault) 的关系（v0.2 起）：**它的表面已并到这里**——同一套动词、同一套 `#标签` 语法、同一套打分（标签 3 分 / 正文 1 分），只是存进同一个 `pins.jsonl`。分工本来就靠消费方式：便签\"每次都直接告诉模型\"，事实\"模型自己去查\"。审计指出 fact-vault 的病是\"存了没有消费端\"，所以这里把事实条目明确排除在注入预算之外，靠 `/facts find` 与 `fact_search` 取用；搬家用 `/facts import`（只读源文件）。","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-plugin-pinboard"}
{"unit_id":"121212165__dsh-plugin-pinboard#readme-5","repo":"121212165/dsh-plugin-pinboard","commit":"1a2c2017f0aaec308d2c6a7f5c1bd52ada0f3e8e","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-pinboard README · 用法：- **`/pin <一句话> [#标签…]`**：置顶一条便签（多余空白压成单行；重复内容不重复入库）。标签是元数据，**不进注入正文**，只用于列表与检索。\n- **`/facts save|find|list|rm|import`**：事实库（存下来供检索，**不注入**）。`save 事实 #标签` / `find 关键词` / `rm <id>`；`import [--from <路径>]` 一次性搬 `~/.dsh/fact-vault/facts.jsonl`——**只读源文件**，重复跳过、坏行计数，源文件字节不动。\n- **`/unpin <id>`**：取消置顶（`#` 前缀可带可不带）。\n- **`/pins`**：列出全部便签，`●` 表示真的会注入、`○` 表示因超出条数/字符上限被挤出去了。\n- **`pin_add` 工具**：模型自己置顶——只在用户明确说\"记住/以后都\"时调用，返回值会告知是否进入了注入预算。","source":"extracted","section":"用法"}
{"unit_id":"121212165__dsh-plugin-pinboard#readme-6","repo":"121212165/dsh-plugin-pinboard","commit":"1a2c2017f0aaec308d2c6a7f5c1bd52ada0f3e8e","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-pinboard README · 用法：- **`fact_search` 工具**：模型自查事实库（标签命中 3 分、正文命中 1 分）。回答\"我们之前定过/查过 X 吗\"之前先调它，而不是凭记忆答——这条消费端正是 fact-vault 缺的。","source":"extracted","section":"用法"}
{"unit_id":"121212165__dsh-plugin-pinboard#readme-7","repo":"121212165/dsh-plugin-pinboard","commit":"1a2c2017f0aaec308d2c6a7f5c1bd52ada0f3e8e","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-pinboard README · 配置：| 字段 | 默认 | 说明 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `enabled` | `true` | |\n| `dataPath` | `~/.dsh/pinboard/pins.jsonl` | 便签与事实共用的单文件库 |\n| `limit` / `maxChars` | `12` / `1200` | **注入预算**：只算便签，事实永远不占额度 |\n| `order` | `700` | 注入段在系统提示里的位置 |\n| `factLimit` | `10` | `/facts find` 与 `fact_search` 最多打印几条命中 |\n| `factsPath` | `~/.dsh/fact-vault/facts.jsonl` | `/facts import` 的默认源文件 |\n\n`order` / `factLimit` / `factsPath` 走启动自检：填错即启动失败并点名 pinboard。","source":"extracted","section":"配置"}
{"unit_id":"121212165__dsh-plugin-pinboard#readme-8","repo":"121212165/dsh-plugin-pinboard","commit":"1a2c2017f0aaec308d2c6a7f5c1bd52ada0f3e8e","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-pinboard README · 配置：便签存为 `~/.dsh/pinboard/pins.jsonl`（按月不切分，单文件）。注入通过 `ctx.systemPrompt.section()`，段落文本是**每次组装时求值**的 provider，所以中途新增的便签下一回合就生效，不需要重启 dsh。","source":"extracted","section":"配置"}
{"unit_id":"121212165__dsh-plugin-pinboard#readme-9","repo":"121212165/dsh-plugin-pinboard","commit":"1a2c2017f0aaec308d2c6a7f5c1bd52ada0f3e8e","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-pinboard README · 注入预算（关键设计）：便签会长期占系统提示，所以预算是硬的：\n\n| 字段 | 默认 | 说明 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `enabled` | `true` | 关掉则完全不注册命令与段落 |\n| `dataPath` | `~/.dsh/pinboard/pins.jsonl` | 便签文件 |\n| `limit` | `12` | 最多注入几条 |\n| `maxChars` | `1200` | 注入行的总字符上限（不含段落标题） |\n| `order` | `700` | 系统提示段落顺序（官方工具段落从 1000 起，700 在策略段之后、工具段之前） |\n\n选择规则：按 `at` 倒序（最新优先），逐条累加字符，装不下就停。**唯一一条超长时截断而不是丢弃**（末尾加 `…`），保证最新一条一定到达。\n\n注入段落形态：\n\n```text","source":"extracted","section":"注入预算（关键设计）"}
{"unit_id":"121212165__dsh-plugin-pinboard#readme-10","repo":"121212165/dsh-plugin-pinboard","commit":"1a2c2017f0aaec308d2c6a7f5c1bd52ada0f3e8e","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-pinboard README · 置顶便签（pinboard）：用户置顶的持久指令，跨所有会话生效，优先于临时对话中的同类约定：\n- 一律使用中文回答\n- 代码注释也使用中文\n```","source":"extracted","section":"置顶便签（pinboard）"}
